{"title":"关闭Mac OS ABC输入法","date":"2026-05-24T08:47:34.372Z","source":"_posts/关闭Mac OS ABC输入法.md","raw":"---\ntitle: 关闭Mac OS ABC输入法\ncategories: [RD]\n---\n有些小伙伴，想只使用鼠须管作为输入法，移除macOS自带的ABC输入法的干扰。其实很简单，修改`com.apple.HIToolbox.plist`文件即可\n\n```plain\n# 使用xcode打开com.apple.HIToolbox.plist文件\nsudo open ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.HIToolbox.plist\n```\n\n依次点开Root -> AppleEnabledInputSources-item-KeyboardLayout Name-ABC 删掉","slug":"关闭Mac OS ABC输入法","published":true,"updated":"2026-05-24T08:47:34.372Z","_id":"cuidJGAlcMKA91f5VybaToCey","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<p>有些小伙伴，想只使用鼠须管作为输入法，移除macOS自带的ABC输入法的干扰。其实很简单，修改<code>com.apple.HIToolbox.plist</code>文件即可</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"># 使用xcode打开com.apple.HIToolbox.plist文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo open ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.HIToolbox.plist</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>依次点开Root -&gt; AppleEnabledInputSources-item-KeyboardLayout Name-ABC 删掉</p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>有些小伙伴，想只使用鼠须管作为输入法，移除macOS自带的ABC输入法的干扰。其实很简单，修改<code>com.apple.HIToolbox.plist</code>文件即可</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"># 使用xcode打开com.apple.HIToolbox.plist文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo open ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.HIToolbox.plist</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>依次点开Root -&gt; AppleEnabledInputSources-item-KeyboardLayout Name-ABC 删掉</p>\n","path":"2026/05/24/关闭Mac OS ABC输入法/","permalink":"https://fengwei7.github.io/2026/05/24/%E5%85%B3%E9%97%ADMac%20OS%20ABC%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%B3%95/","tags":[],"categories":[{"name":"RD","_id":"cuidF5XrwRL4WM-GYuy4Ocs2d","slug":"RD","path":"categories/RD/","permalink":"https://fengwei